_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/skein-mass-relation-proof.lean#L30-L30","doc":"q is greater than 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation.q","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/skein-mass-relation-proof.lean#L28-L28","doc":"The substrate parameter q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/skein-mass-relation-proof.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.SkeinMassRelation","kind":"structure","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/skein-mass-relation-proof.lean#L20-L39","doc":"The **Skein mass relation**: at a crossing in the color-exchange\nspace, the mass functional satisfies the q-deformed Skein relation.\n\n- `m_plus`:  mass of the `L₊` resolution (positive crossing)\n- `m_minus`: mass of the `L₋` resolution (negative crossing)\n- `m_zero`:  mass of the `L₀` resolution (smoothing) ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prf:skein-mass-relation","label":"prf:skein-mass-relation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/skein-mass-relation-proof.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}